---
/**
 * MachineryInspectionStory.astro
 * Canonical Mobile Specification for Machinery Pre-operational Inspection Checklist
 * Persona: Operador de Maquinaria y Técnico de Mantenimiento en Terreno
 */
---

<div class="story-screen-container" id="story-inspeccion">
  
  <!-- Story Header -->
  <header class="story-header">
    <div class="story-meta-badge">
      <i class="pi pi-wrench"></i>
      <span>INSPECCIÓN PRE-OPERACIONAL DE CAMPO · SEGURIDAD INDUSTRIAL & EQUIPOS</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="story-title">Checklist Pre-operacional de Maquinaria y Vehículos Pesados</h2>
    <p class="story-desc">
      Diseño nativo en <strong>Android Jetpack Compose</strong> para la inspección obligatoria de inicio de turno (montacargas, camiones grúa, plataformas y excavadoras). Diseñado para uso con guantes industriales (touch targets de 56dp), selector trifásico rápido (OK / Alerta / Crítico), captura fotográfica obligatoria de anomalías con CameraX y firma de conformidad.
    </p>
  </header>

  <!-- Interactive Story Workbench -->
  <div class="story-workbench-layout">
    
    <!-- Left: Functional Steps -->
    <div class="story-details-col">
      
      <!-- Phase Navigation -->
      <div class="phase-selector-bar" role="tablist">
        <button type="button" class="phase-btn active" data-phase="checkpoints">
          <span>1. Puntos de Control</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="phase-btn" data-phase="selector">
          <span>2. Selector 56dp</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="phase-btn" data-phase="evidence">
          <span>3. Evidencia Foto</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="phase-btn" data-phase="sign">
          <span>4. Firma y Bloqueo</span>
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Phase 1: Checkpoints -->
      <div class="phase-panel active" id="panel-phase-checkpoints">
        <div class="panel-card">
          <div class="panel-card-header">
            <span class="step-num">PASO 1</span>
            <h3>Categorías de Inspección Pre-Turno</h3>
          </div>
          <p>
            El checklist está agrupado en 5 módulos críticos. Cada ítem debe responderse antes de permitir el inicio de operaciones del equipo.
          </p>
          <ul class="story-spec-list">
            <li><strong>1. Motor & Niveles:</strong> Aceite motor, refrigerante, nivel diésel y batería.</li>
            <li><strong>2. Sistema de Frenos:</strong> Freno de pedal, freno de emergencia y presión hidráulica.</li>
            <li><strong>3. Luces & Señales:</strong> Faro delantero, baliza estroboscópica y alarma sonora de retroceso.</li>
            <li><strong>4. Estructura & Mástil:</strong> Horquillas sin fisuras, mangueras sin fugas de aceite.</li>
            <li><strong>5. EPP & Cabina:</strong> Cinturón de seguridad, extintor vigente y espejo retrovisor.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Phase 2: 56dp Selector -->
      <div class="phase-panel" id="panel-phase-selector">
        <div class="panel-card">
          <div class="panel-card-header">
            <span class="step-num">PASO 2</span>
            <h3>Selectores Trifásicos para Guantes (56dp Bounding Box)</h3>
          </div>
          <p>
            En talleres y canteras, los operadores usan guantes de cuero o nitrilo grueso. Los controles son de 56dp de altura mínima con retroalimentación háptica vibratoria.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Phase 3: Evidence -->
      <div class="phase-panel" id="panel-phase-evidence">
        <div class="panel-card">
          <div class="panel-card-header">
            <span class="step-num">PASO 3</span>
            <h3>Captura Obligatoria de Foto en CameraX</h3>
          </div>
          <p>
            Al marcar cualquier ítem como <em>Alerta</em> o <em>Crítico</em>, la app despliega automáticamente el visor CameraX para documentar la fisura o fuga.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Phase 4: Sign & Lock -->
      <div class="phase-panel" id="panel-phase-sign">
        <div class="panel-card">
          <div class="panel-card-header">
            <span class="step-num">PASO 4</span>
            <h3>Firma Electrónica y Bloqueo de Operación</h3>
          </div>
          <p>
            Si se detecta una falla crítica (ej: fuga de frenos), el vehículo queda automáticamente en estado <strong>BLOQUEADO PARA OPERACIÓN</strong> y se genera un ticket para Mantenimiento.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Compose Code -->
      <div class="compose-code-snippet">
        <div class="snippet-header">
          <span class="code-tag">Kotlin · Jetpack Compose</span>
          <span class="code-file">apps/operations-android/.../PreOperationalChecklistScreen.kt</span>
        </div>
        <pre><code><span class="kw">@Composable</span>
<span class="kw">fun</span> <span class="fn">PreOperationalInspectionScreen</span>(
    machineryId: <span class="type">String</span>,
    items: <span class="type">List</span>&lt;<span class="type">CheckItem</span>&gt;,
    onItemStatusChanged: (itemId: <span class="type">String</span>, status: <span class="type">CheckStatus</span>) -&gt; <span class="type">Unit</span>,
    onPhotoEvidenceRequired: (itemId: <span class="type">String</span>) -&gt; <span class="type">Unit</span>,
    onCompleteInspection: () -&gt; <span class="type">Unit</span>
) &#123;
    <span class="type">LazyColumn</span>(
        modifier = <span class="type">Modifier</span>.<span class="fn">fillMaxSize</span>().<span class="fn">padding</span>(<span class="num">16</span>.dp),
        verticalArrangement = <span class="type">Arrangement</span>.<span class="fn">spacedBy</span>(<span class="num">12</span>.dp)
    ) &#123;
        items(items) &#123; item -&gt;
            <span class="type">GloveTriStateCard</span>(
                item = item,
                onSelectStatus = &#123; status -&gt; onItemStatusChanged(item.id, status) &#125;,
                onPhotoClick = &#123; onPhotoEvidenceRequired(item.id) &#125;
            )
        &#125;
    &#125;
&#125;</code></pre>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Right: Smartphone Simulator Preview -->
    <div class="story-preview-col">
      <div class="mini-device-stand">
        <div class="mini-chassis">
          <div class="mini-notch"><div class="mini-camera"></div></div>
          <div class="mini-status-bar">
            <span>07:45</span>
            <div class="status-right"><i class="pi pi-wifi"></i><span>4G</span><i class="pi pi-battery"></i></div>
          </div>

          <div class="driver-app-content">
            <div class="app-topbar" style="background: #082846;">
              <i class="pi pi-wrench"></i>
              <span class="topbar-title">Montacargas #MK-09 · Pre-Turno</span>
              <span class="offline-pill" style="background: #eab308;" title="1 alerta detectada"><i class="pi pi-exclamation"></i></span>
            </div>

            <div class="app-scroll-body">
              
              <!-- Machinery Spec Header -->
              <div class="machinery-meta-card">
                <span class="mach-badge">EQUIPO: TOYOTA 8FGU25 (SERIE #8921)</span>
                <strong class="mach-title">Inspección de Seguridad Diaria</strong>
                <span class="mach-horometer">Horómetro actual: <b>1,420.5 hrs</b> · Operador: Diego S.</span>
              </div>

              <!-- Checklist Item 1 -->
              <div class="check-item-card">
                <div class="check-label-row">
                  <span class="check-num">01</span>
                  <strong class="check-text">Frenos de Servicio y Emergencia</strong>
                </div>
                <div class="tri-state-buttons">
                  <button type="button" class="btn-tri ok active">✔ OK</button>
                  <button type="button" class="btn-tri warn">⚠️ Alerta</button>
                  <button type="button" class="btn-tri error">❌ Crítico</button>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Checklist Item 2 (With Alert & Photo required) -->
              <div class="check-item-card" style="border-color: #fde68a; background: #fffdf5;">
                <div class="check-label-row">
                  <span class="check-num">02</span>
                  <strong class="check-text">Fugas de Aceite Hidráulico</strong>
                </div>
                <div class="tri-state-buttons">
                  <button type="button" class="btn-tri ok">✔ OK</button>
                  <button type="button" class="btn-tri warn active">⚠️ Alerta</button>
                  <button type="button" class="btn-tri error">❌ Crítico</button>
                </div>
                <!-- Photo Attachment Prompt -->
                <div class="photo-attach-box">
                  <i class="pi pi-camera"></i>
                  <span>Foto requerida: Goteo leve en manguera pistón derecho</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Checklist Item 3 -->
              <div class="check-item-card">
                <div class="check-label-row">
                  <span class="check-num">03</span>
                  <strong class="check-text">Alarma de Retroceso & Bocina</strong>
                </div>
                <div class="tri-state-buttons">
                  <button type="button" class="btn-tri ok active">✔ OK</button>
                  <button type="button" class="btn-tri warn">⚠️ Alerta</button>
                  <button type="button" class="btn-tri error">❌ Crítico</button>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Checklist Item 4 -->
              <div class="check-item-card">
                <div class="check-label-row">
                  <span class="check-num">04</span>
                  <strong class="check-text">Extintor y Cinturón de Seguridad</strong>
                </div>
                <div class="tri-state-buttons">
                  <button type="button" class="btn-tri ok active">✔ OK</button>
                  <button type="button" class="btn-tri warn">⚠️ Alerta</button>
                  <button type="button" class="btn-tri error">❌ Crítico</button>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Final Submit Button -->
              <button type="button" class="btn-app-action" style="background: #15803d; color: white;">
                <i class="pi pi-check-circle"></i>
                <span>Firmar y Habilitar Montacargas</span>
              </button>

            </div>

            <div class="app-bottom-nav">
              <div class="nav-tab active"><i class="pi pi-check-square"></i><span>Checklist</span></div>
              <div class="nav-tab"><i class="pi pi-wrench"></i><span>Mantenimiento</span></div>
              <div class="nav-tab"><i class="pi pi-history"></i><span>Turnos</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mini-gesture"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

</div>

<style>
  .story-screen-container { width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; animation: fadeIn 0.25s ease-out; }
  .story-header { background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.04); }
  .story-meta-badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; background: #eff6ff; color: #1d4ed8; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .story-title { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .story-desc { color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; max-width: 900px; }
  .story-workbench-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 380px; gap: 28px; align-items: start; }
  @media (max-width: 1080px) { .story-workbench-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .story-details-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
  .phase-selector-bar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 6px; border-radius: 10px; }
  .phase-btn { background: transparent; border: 0; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #475569; cursor: pointer; }
  .phase-btn.active { background: #2563eb; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; }
  .phase-panel { display: none; }
  .phase-panel.active { display: block; }
  .panel-card { background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 14px; padding: 20px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.04); }
  .panel-card-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .step-num { background: #e2e8f0; color: #334155; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; }
  .panel-card-header h3 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin: 0; }
  .panel-card p { font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .story-spec-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; font-size: 12.5px; color: #334155; }
  .story-spec-list li { padding-left: 14px; position: relative; }
  .story-spec-list li::before { content: "•"; color: #2563eb; position: absolute; left: 0; font-weight: bold; }

  /* Device Preview */
  .story-preview-col { position: sticky; top: 80px; width: 380px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .mini-device-stand { display: flex; justify-content: center; }
  .mini-chassis { width: 360px; height: 720px; background: #000000; border-radius: 42px; padding: 12px; box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(15,23,42,0.2), 0 0 0 1px #334155; display: flex; flex-direction: column; position: relative; }
  .mini-notch { position: absolute; top: 14px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); width: 80px; height: 18px; background: #000000; border-radius: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; z-index: 20; }
  .mini-camera { width: 9px; height: 9px; background: #1e293b; border-radius: 50%; }
  .mini-status-bar { height: 24px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 0 16px; font-size: 11px; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 600; }
  .status-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; font-size: 10px; }
  .driver-app-content { flex: 1; background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 30px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .app-topbar { height: 48px; background: #082846; color: #ffffff; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0 14px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }
  .offline-pill { width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 10px; color: #ffffff; }
  .app-scroll-body { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; scrollbar-width: none; }
  .machinery-meta-card { background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
  .mach-badge { font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 800; color: #0284c7; }
  .mach-title { font-size: 13px; color: #0f172a; }
  .mach-horometer { font-size: 10.5px; color: #64748b; }
  .check-item-card { background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .check-label-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .check-num { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; color: #94a3b8; font-family: monospace; }
  .check-text { font-size: 12px; color: #0f172a; }
  .tri-state-buttons { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 6px; }
  .btn-tri { height: 42px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; background: #ffffff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; color: #475569; }
  .btn-tri.ok.active { background: #dcfce7; border-color: #86efac; color: #15803d; }
  .btn-tri.warn.active { background: #fef3c7; border-color: #fde68a; color: #b45309; }
  .btn-tri.error.active { background: #fee2e2; border-color: #fca5a5; color: #b91c1c; }
  .photo-attach-box { background: #fef3c7; border: 1px dashed #f59e0b; border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px 8px; font-size: 10px; color: #92400e; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-weight: 600; }
  .btn-app-action { height: 48px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; border: 0; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; }
  .app-bottom-nav { height: 52px; background: #ffffff; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-around; }
  .nav-tab { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 2px; color: #64748b; font-size: 9.5px; }
  .nav-tab.active { color: #1d4ed8; font-weight: 700; }
  .mini-gesture { width: 110px; height: 4px; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 2px; align-self: center; margin-top: 8px; opacity: 0.6; }
  .compose-code-snippet { background: #0f172a; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; font-family: var(--nexa-font-family-mono, monospace); font-size: 11.5px; color: #e2e8f0; }
  .snippet-header { background: #1e293b; padding: 8px 14px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 11px; }
  .code-tag { color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; }
  .code-file { color: #94a3b8; }
  .compose-code-snippet pre { margin: 0; padding: 16px; overflow-x: auto; line-height: 1.5; }
  .kw { color: #f43f5e; font-weight: 700; }
  .fn { color: #38bdf8; }
  .type { color: #a78bfa; }
  .num { color: #fbbf24; }
</style>

<script>
  const phaseButtons = document.querySelectorAll('#story-inspeccion .phase-btn');
  const phasePanels = document.querySelectorAll('#story-inspeccion .phase-panel');

  phaseButtons.forEach(btn => {
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      phaseButtons.forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));
      btn.classList.add('active');

      const phase = btn.getAttribute('data-phase');
      phasePanels.forEach(panel => {
        panel.classList.toggle('active', panel.id === `panel-phase-${phase}`);
      });
    });
  });
</script>
